<dict>
    <key>ConsentText</key>
    <dict>
        <key>default</key>
        <string>
            ⚠️⚠️⚠️ WARNING – NOT RECOMMENDED FOR ANY USE ⚠️⚠️⚠️

            Profile 5: COMPLETE Apple Service Blocklist (Extended)

            This profile blocks virtually EVERY Apple service domain known — iCloud, App Store, iMessage, FaceTime, Siri, Maps, push notifications, updates, backups, activation, Find My, Apple Pay, Game Center, News, Weather, Stocks, Fitness+, Arcade, Music, TV+, Books, Podcasts, HomeKit, Health, Screen Time, Family Sharing, Apple Card, Apple Cash, Private Relay, Hide My Email, and more.

            🔴 YOUR DEVICE WILL BECOME ALMOST COMPLETELY NON‑FUNCTIONAL:
            • No iCloud sync, backup, or Drive
            • No App Store or app updates
            • No iMessage or FaceTime
            • No Siri, Maps, Weather, or News
            • No push notifications
            • No software updates
            • No Apple Pay / Card / Cash
            • No Find My
            • No HomeKit, Health, Screen Time, Family Sharing
            • No device activation (if re‑activated)
            • No certificate validation (same as Profile 1)
            • No time sync (can break TLS certificate validation)
            • No analytics, no ads (by accident)

            Note: This list also blocks Akamai infrastructure domains (akadns.net, edgekey.com, edgesuite.net) used by many non‑Apple services. Netflix, Adobe, and various enterprise apps may also break.

            This profile is provided ONLY for testing, reference, or extreme cases where you intentionally want to disconnect an iOS device from all Apple services. It is NOT recommended for daily use.

            DNS Mobile Configuration By: Nexus Signer
        </string>
    </dict>

