    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>
        ⚠️⚠️⚠️ PROFILE 5: COMPLETE APPLE SERVICE BLACKOUT (EXTENDED) ⚠️⚠️⚠️

        This profile blocks ~240 Apple-related domains, effectively cutting your device off from nearly all Apple services. This includes, but is not limited to:

        ❌ iCloud (all sync, Drive, Photos, Backup, Mail, Keychain)
        ❌ iCloud+ Private Relay &amp; Hide My Email
        ❌ App Store, iTunes Store &amp; App Store Connect
        ❌ iMessage &amp; FaceTime
        ❌ Push Notifications (APNs)
        ❌ Siri &amp; Dictation
        ❌ Apple Maps &amp; Location Services
        ❌ Find My iPhone / Find My / AirTag
        ❌ Apple Pay, Apple Card, Apple Cash, Wallet &amp; Savings
        ❌ Game Center &amp; Apple Arcade
        ❌ Apple Music, TV+, Fitness+, Books, Podcasts &amp; News+
        ❌ HomeKit / Home app
        ❌ Health &amp; Watch
        ❌ Handoff, Continuity, AirDrop, AirPlay
        ❌ Screen Time &amp; Family Sharing
        ❌ Apple One
        ❌ Apple Translate
        ❌ Weather &amp; WeatherKit, Stocks, News
        ❌ Software Updates &amp; Recovery
        ❌ Device Activation &amp; Setup
        ❌ Apple ID / Sign in with Apple / Authentication
        ❌ Apple Store
        ❌ MDM, Configurator, Profile Manager
        ❌ Apple Business Manager &amp; Apple School Manager
        ❌ All CDN &amp; Edge content delivery
        ❌ Time sync (NTP) — may break TLS validation

        Additionally, because akadns.net, edgekey.com, and edgesuite.net are shared Akamai infrastructure, some non-Apple services (Netflix, Adobe, enterprise apps) may also break.

        🔴 THIS PROFILE IS PROVIDED FOR REFERENCE ONLY.
        DO NOT INSTALL unless you fully understand that your device will become extremely limited and essentially unusable for normal daily functions. Certificate validation is also blocked (same as Profile 1), creating a security risk.

        You have been warned.
    </string>

    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
    <string>☠️ ALL Apple Domains Blocked (Extended)</string>
    <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
    <string>com.nexus.config.all-apple-block</string>
    <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
    <string>Nexus - Mobile Configuration</string>
    <key>PayloadType</key>
    <string>Configuration</string>
    <key>PayloadUUID</key>
    <string>B2C3D4E5-0005-0005-0005-000000000001</string>
    <key>PayloadVersion</key>
    <integer>1</integer>

    <key>ProhibitDisablement</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
